    "title_en": "Divergences in Nonpolynomial Quantum Field Theories",
    "abstract_en": "The structure of divergences in several nonpolynomial scalar quantum field theories are investigated. Various $n$-point Green functions for nonpolynomial theories are calculated and their renormalization is analyzed, with special regard for the nonpolynomial $\\left|φ\\right|^{3}$ theory in $4$ spacetime dimensions.",
